      "topic": "ai",
      "title": "The interesting model this week was the mid-tier one",
      "caption": "Everyone watched the frontier launches; Anthropic quietly shipped Claude Sonnet 5, its most agentic *mid-tier* model. That's the real race — not the flagship nobody can afford to run at scale, but the cheap one that's finally good enough to put in a loop.",
      "format": "tabloid",
      "bestPlatform": "mastodon",
